{"seq":2,"slug":"dom-ceiling","title":"DOM 渲染的成本天花板","url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/frontend-webgl-canvas-rendering/foundations/dom-ceiling","wordCount":1616,"readingTime":7,"html":"<h1 id=\"dom-渲染的成本天花板\">DOM 渲染的成本天花板</h1><p>「DOM 慢」是句被说滥的话，滥到失去了指导意义。真正有用的问法是：它到底慢在哪一步、慢多少、从哪个规模开始慢到无法接受？把这三个问题答清楚，你才能拿着 Chrome 的 Performance 面板去判断「这个需求现在就该上 Canvas」，而不是凭感觉。这篇文档把 DOM 每一帧的开销拆成三笔可度量的账，并给出那条真实存在的天花板。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念-像素管线的三笔账\">核心概念：像素管线的三笔账</h2><p>浏览器把一次 DOM 更新渲染到屏幕，要走一条固定的流水线。抛开 JavaScript 执行与样式计算，落到「画面」上的主要是三步，每一步都是一笔独立的成本账。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;  A[JS 改动 DOM/样式] --&gt; B[Style 样式重算]&#10;  B --&gt; C[Layout 布局/重排]&#10;  C --&gt; D[Paint 绘制/生成绘制指令]&#10;  D --&gt; E[Composite 合成/图层贴合]&#10;  E --&gt; F[屏幕像素]&#10;  C -.仅几何变化时可跳过.-&gt; D&#10;  D -.仅 transform/opacity 变化.-&gt; E\">flowchart TD\n  A[JS 改动 DOM/样式] --&gt; B[Style 样式重算]\n  B --&gt; C[Layout 布局/重排]\n  C --&gt; D[Paint 绘制/生成绘制指令]\n  D --&gt; E[Composite 合成/图层贴合]\n  E --&gt; F[屏幕像素]\n  C -.仅几何变化时可跳过.-&gt; D\n  D -.仅 transform/opacity 变化.-&gt; E</pre><p><strong>Layout（布局，又称 reflow）</strong> 计算每个元素的几何：位置、尺寸、相对关系。它的成本随参与布局的节点数增长，而且是「传染」的——改一个元素的宽度，可能迫使它的兄弟、父级乃至整棵子树重新计算。<strong>Paint（绘制）</strong> 把每个元素变成填充、边框、文字、阴影等绘制指令，成本与绘制区域面积和样式复杂度相关。<strong>Composite（合成）</strong> 把分好的图层按层叠关系贴合成最终画面，通常在 GPU 上完成，是三者里最便宜的。这三笔账里，布局和绘制跑在主线程，是卡顿的主要来源；它们与合成的详细分工，属于兄弟 hub <a href=\"../../browser-rendering-internals/pipeline/layout-reflow\">浏览器渲染内幕 · 布局与重排</a> 的范畴，本文只取「成本」这个切面。</p>\n<h2 id=\"三笔账里谁最贵\">三笔账里谁最贵</h2><p>不是每次改动都触发全部三步。浏览器有一条优化路径：只改 <code>transform</code> 和 <code>opacity</code> 的动画可以跳过布局和绘制，直接走合成——这就是「只用 transform 做动画」这条老建议的原理。但一旦你改的是几何属性（<code>width</code>、<code>top</code>、<code>left</code>、<code>font-size</code>）或会影响文档流的属性，布局就被迫重来，而且是整条链条从头走。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>阶段</th>\n<th>触发条件</th>\n<th>运行线程</th>\n<th>相对成本</th>\n<th>能否避免</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>Style 重算</td>\n<td>类名/样式变更</td>\n<td>主线程</td>\n<td>中</td>\n<td>收窄选择器影响范围</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Layout 重排</td>\n<td>几何/文档流变化</td>\n<td>主线程</td>\n<td>高</td>\n<td>用 transform 替代 top/left</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Paint 重绘</td>\n<td>颜色/背景/阴影变化</td>\n<td>主线程</td>\n<td>中高</td>\n<td>提层 / 缩小重绘区</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Composite 合成</td>\n<td>transform/opacity</td>\n<td>合成线程/GPU</td>\n<td>低</td>\n<td>一般无需避免</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>结论是：<strong>布局是 DOM 帧成本的主峰</strong>，绘制次之。而这两者恰恰是节点数越多越贵、且难以搬离主线程的部分。这就把问题引向了规模——到底多少节点会撞破天花板。</p>\n<h2 id=\"天花板在哪-帧预算的算术\">天花板在哪：帧预算的算术</h2><p>60fps 意味着每帧只有约 16.7 毫秒完成「JS + 样式 + 布局 + 绘制 + 合成」的全部工作。留给布局和绘制的实际预算往往只有几毫秒，因为 JS 逻辑和样式重算已经先吃掉一部分。设单个节点参与一次布局的平均成本为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>t</mi><mtext>node</mtext></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">t_{\\text{node}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7651em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">node</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>，则一帧能承受的动态节点上限近似为：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>N</mi><mi>max</mi><mo>⁡</mo></msub><mo>≈</mo><mfrac><mrow><msub><mi>T</mi><mtext>frame</mtext></msub><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>t</mi><mtext>js</mtext></msub><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>t</mi><mtext>style</mtext></msub></mrow><msub><mi>t</mi><mtext>node</mtext></msub></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">N_{\\max} \\approx \\frac{T_{\\text{frame}} - t_{\\text{js}} - t_{\\text{style}}}{t_{\\text{node}}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.109em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mop mtight\"><span class=\"mtight\">m</span><span class=\"mtight\">a</span><span class=\"mtight\">x</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≈</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.1963em;vertical-align:-0.836em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3603em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">node</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">frame</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3175em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">js</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">style</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.836em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>T</mi><mtext>frame</mtext></msub><mo>≈</mo><mn>16.7</mn><mtext>ms</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">T_{\\text{frame}} \\approx 16.7\\text{ms}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">frame</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≈</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">16.7</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">ms</span></span></span></span></span></span>。<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>t</mi><mtext>node</mtext></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">t_{\\text{node}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7651em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">node</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 在现代设备上是微秒级，但它会被样式复杂度、盒模型嵌套深度放大。经验上，当页面里<strong>每帧都在变动</strong>的节点数进入数千量级，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>N</mi><mo>⋅</mo><msub><mi>t</mi><mtext>node</mtext></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">N \\cdot t_{\\text{node}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7651em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">node</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 就逼近甚至超出预算，掉帧开始出现——这正是上一篇 <a href=\"why-canvas-webgl\">为何需要 Canvas 与 WebGL</a> 里那条成本曲线在现实中的落点。注意这里的关键词是「每帧变动」：一个有一万个静态节点、但只有几十个在动的页面，往往依然流畅，因为浏览器只为变动部分重排重绘。</p>\n<p>真正的杀手是两类场景：其一，大量节点同时高频变动（实时看板、密集动画、拖拽整片元素）；其二，一次改动引发大范围重排（在长列表顶部插入元素、改动影响后续所有兄弟的尺寸）。这两类都会让 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>N</mi><mo>⋅</mo><msub><mi>t</mi><mtext>node</mtext></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">N \\cdot t_{\\text{node}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7651em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">node</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 集中爆发在单帧内。</p>\n<h2 id=\"逼近天花板前能做什么-以及何时该放弃-dom\">逼近天花板前能做什么，以及何时该放弃 DOM</h2><p>撞墙之前，DOM 侧还有几级优化可用，值得先试：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>避免强制同步布局（layout thrashing）</strong>：在循环里交替「写样式—读几何（如 <code>offsetHeight</code>）」会逼浏览器反复同步重排。把读和写分批（先全读后全写）能消除这类自伤。</li>\n<li><strong>用合成层承接动画</strong>：把频繁动的元素限制在 <code>transform</code>/<code>opacity</code> 上，让它们走合成快路，绕开布局与绘制。</li>\n<li><strong>虚拟化（windowing）</strong>：长列表只渲染视口内的节点，把「一万个 DOM 节点」压成「几十个」，这是列表类场景的标准解法，细节见兄弟 hub <a href=\"../../frontend-virtual-scrolling/foundations/why-virtual-scrolling\">前端虚拟滚动</a>。</li>\n<li><strong>减少重绘区</strong>：给频繁变化的区域单独提层，避免它的重绘牵连整页。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>当这些手段都用尽，需求仍然是「几千上万个图元每帧都在独立变动」——比如粒子、密集散点、自由画布——就到了 DOM 的绝对天花板。此时唯一的出路是切换渲染模型，把这些图元从「一万个受管理的对象」变成「一块画布上的一万条绘制指令」。该选 Canvas 2D 还是 WebGL，取决于图元数量级与是否需要 GPU 特效，这正是下一篇 <a href=\"graphics-api-landscape\">API 谱系</a> 要回答的。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>DOM 每帧的成本主要是三笔账：Style 重算、Layout 布局、Paint 绘制，外加便宜的 Composite 合成；布局和绘制跑在主线程，是卡顿主因。</li>\n<li>只改 transform/opacity 能走合成快路，绕开布局与绘制；改几何属性则强制整条链条重来。</li>\n<li>天花板由帧预算的算术决定：当<strong>每帧变动</strong>的节点数进入数千量级，布局成本逼近 16.7ms 预算，掉帧出现；静态节点多不致命，高频变动的节点多才致命。</li>\n<li>撞墙前先试「批量读写避免强制同步布局、用合成层承接动画、虚拟化、缩小重绘区」；这些用尽仍不够时，才切换到 Canvas/WebGL 的即时模式。</li>\n</ul>\n<h3 id=\"延伸阅读\">延伸阅读</h3><ul>\n<li>本 hub：<a href=\"why-canvas-webgl\">为何需要 Canvas 与 WebGL</a> 给出即时模式与保留模式的成本对比；<a href=\"graphics-api-landscape\">API 谱系</a> 决定撞墙后切到哪套 API。</li>\n<li>跨 hub：布局、绘制、合成的内部机制见 <a href=\"../../browser-rendering-internals/pipeline/layout-reflow\">浏览器渲染内幕 · 布局与重排</a>；帧预算与掉帧的度量见 <a href=\"../../web-performance-vitals/foundations/performance-model\">Web 性能与核心指标 · 性能模型</a>。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"DOM 渲染的成本天花板","id":"dom-渲染的成本天花板"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念：像素管线的三笔账","id":"核心概念-像素管线的三笔账"},{"level":2,"text":"三笔账里谁最贵","id":"三笔账里谁最贵"},{"level":2,"text":"天花板在哪：帧预算的算术","id":"天花板在哪-帧预算的算术"},{"level":2,"text":"逼近天花板前能做什么，以及何时该放弃 DOM","id":"逼近天花板前能做什么-以及何时该放弃-dom"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"},{"level":3,"text":"延伸阅读","id":"延伸阅读"}],"prev":{"title":"为何需要 Canvas 与 WebGL","url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/frontend-webgl-canvas-rendering/foundations/why-canvas-webgl"},"next":{"title":"API 谱系：Canvas 2D、WebGL 与 WebGPU","url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/frontend-webgl-canvas-rendering/foundations/graphics-api-landscape"}}